# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time about 2 s.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 27
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2500
wait 1500
tapkey w4
wait 4000
shot s-back-0.png
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 4000
shot s-back-1.png
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 4000
